摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH plugin: auto-sync conversation turns to Honcho memory service","id":"gh:1335223977","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-honcho-sync","slug":"nanpaidashi/dsh-honcho-sync","topics":["dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH plugin: auto-sync conversation turns to Honcho memory service"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# @nanpaidashi/dsh-honcho-sync"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Honcho Memory Plugin for DeepSeek Harness — give your AI persistent, cross-session memory backed by "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"a self-hosted Honcho v3 service."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"中文 | English"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Auto-sync**: Every conversation turn is automatically synced to Honcho (with debounce). Sync cur"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"sors persist across restarts.\n- **Hybrid recall**: Semantic search across both raw messages AND reas"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"oned conclusions (explicit/deductive/inductive) in parallel.\n- **Memory injection**: On session star"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"t, relevant peer cards, representations, and semantic recall results are injected into the system pr"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"ompt.\n- **25 tools**: Full Honcho v3 API surface exposed as DSH tools — search, profile, session man"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"agement, peer management, conclusions, dreaming, queue monitoring."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness (DSH) with web profile\n- A running Honcho v3 instance (self-hosted)\n- Node.js >= "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"DeepSeek Harness (DSH) with web profile\n- A running Honcho v3 instance (self-hosted)\n- Node.js >= 18"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Then restart DSH:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Upgrading"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"If you installed an earlier version (v0.6.x or v0.7.0):"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The install is idempotent: it replaces the plugin source file in place. Your configuration (settings"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" panel) and sync state (`~/.dsh/honcho-sync-state.json`) are preserved — no data loss, no re-configu"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"nc state (`~/.dsh/honcho-sync-state.json`) are preserved — no data loss, no re-configuration needed."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### v0.8.0 → v0.8.1 changelog"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- **Context efficiency**: Reduced registered tools from 25 to 4 (`honcho_recall`, `honcho_ask`, `hon"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"cho_remember`, `honcho_context`) — saves ~7K tokens of tool schema injection per session\n- **Injecti"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"on quality**: Added `_filterRepresentation()` — removes Pattern [medium]/[low] blocks, Premises/Sour"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"ces provenance chains, and orphan Type/Sources lines from representation injection\n- **Injection qua"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"lity**: Added `_assembleByPriority()` — assembles memory-context parts by priority (peer-card > sess"},{"id":"p18s6","text":"ion-summary > semantic-recall > representation) instead of fixed order\n- **Injection budget**: `inje"},{"id":"p18s7","text":"ctionMaxChars` default 8000 → 4000, `reprMaxObs` default 8 → 4\n- **Tool descriptions**: Shortened al"},{"id":"p18s8","text":"l tool descriptions to ~100 chars"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### v0.7.x → v0.8.0 changelog"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- **DSH 0.1.0-rc.8 compatibility**: Added `normalizeToolParameters()` to convert legacy parameter sh"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"orthand to standard JSON Schema\n- **DSH 0.1.0-rc.8 compatibility**: Added `output.render` returning "},{"id":"p20s3","text":"content blocks array (required by DSH >= 2026)\n- **README**: Removed settings panel references — con"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"figuration is done via environment variables in `~/.config/systemd/user/dsh-web.service`\n- Fixed `co"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"nclusions/query` requiring `filters` parameter\n- Fixed response parsing for `/search`, `/peers/list`"},{"id":"p20s6","text":", `/summaries`\n- Fixed `POST /conclusions` body format\n- Fixed `schedule_dream` parameter name (`dre"},{"id":"p20s7","text":"am_type`)\n- Added 4 tools: `honcho_conclude`, `honcho_conclude_list`, `honcho_conclude_query`, `honc"},{"id":"p20s8","text":"ho_message_get`\n- Hybrid recall now searches messages + conclusions in parallel"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Uninstalling"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"> **Note:** Removing the plugin does NOT delete your Honcho data. All messages, conclusions, and pee"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"r cards remain on your Honcho server. The plugin is just the bridge — your memory is safe."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"**There is no settings panel.** All configuration is done via environment variables in your DSH serv"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"s no settings panel.** All configuration is done via environment variables in your DSH service file."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### Step 1: Edit the DSH service file"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Add these environment variables to the `[Service]` section:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### Step 2: Apply the changes"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Configuration reference"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| Variable | Description | Default |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| `HONCHO_URL` | Honcho API base URL | *(required)* |\n| `HONCHO_WORKSPACE` | Honcho workspace name |"},{"id":"p34s2","text":" *(required)* |\n| `HONCHO_USER_PEER` | Peer ID representing the user | `user` |\n| `HONCHO_AGENT_PEER"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"` | Peer ID representing the agent | `agent` |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"> **Note:** Advanced options (debounce, recall budget, timeouts) use sensible defaults and rarely ne"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"ed tuning. If you do need to customize them, edit the `DEFAULTS` object at the top of `src/index.mjs"},{"id":"p35s3","text":" tuning. If you do need to customize them, edit the `DEFAULTS` object at the top of `src/index.mjs`."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### Honcho Server Setup"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"If you don't have Honcho running yet:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Create a workspace and peers:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"### Memory\n| Tool | Description |"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"| `honcho_recall` | Hybrid semantic search (messages + conclusions). Fast (2-5s). |\n| `honcho_ask` |"},{"id":"p43s2","text":" Deep dialectic reasoning with a peer. Slower (2-5min) but thorough. |\n| `honcho_remember` | Save a "},{"id":"p43s3","text":"fact/statement to Honcho memory. |\n| `honcho_context` | Get compressed conversation context for a se"},{"id":"p43s4","text":"tement to Honcho memory. |\n| `honcho_context` | Get compressed conversation context for a session. |"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"### Search\n| Tool | Description |"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"| `honcho_search` | Search across ALL sessions (no date filter). |\n| `honcho_session_search` | Searc"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"h within a specific session. |"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"## Privacy"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"- All data stays on **your** Honcho server. No third-party data transmission.\n- The plugin does not "},{"id":"p47s2","text":"log message content.\n- Configuration (URL, workspace, peer IDs) is stored in DSH settings, not in th"},{"id":"p47s3","text":"ent.\n- Configuration (URL, workspace, peer IDs) is stored in DSH settings, not in the plugin source."},{"id":"p48s1","text":"## 功能"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"- **自动同步**：每轮对话自动同步到 Honcho（带防抖）。同步游标跨重启持久化。\n- **混合召回**：同时搜索原始消息和推理结论（显式/演绎/归纳），并行执行。\n- **记忆注入**：会话开"},{"id":"p49s2","text":"始时，将相关的 peer 卡片、表征和语义召回结果注入系统提示词。\n- **25 个工具**：覆盖 Honcho v3 完整 API — 搜索、画像、会话管理、peer 管理、结论、做梦、队列监控。"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"## 依赖"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness (DSH) web profile\n- 一个运行中的 Honcho v3 实例（自托管）\n- Node.js >= 18"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"## 隐私"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"- 所有数据保留在**你的** Honcho 服务器上。无第三方数据传输。\n- 插件不记录消息内容。\n- 配置（URL、工作区、peer ID）通过环境变量存储在 DSH 服务文件中，不在插件源码里。"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
